---
description: Rules when editing or creating Unity prefabs and assets
globs: **/Assets/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

- Avoid editing metdata directly and use Unity CLI instead.
- Refer to `/unity-cli` skill for more information.
- If user doesn't have Unity CLI, prompt user to install (see [here](docs.unity.com/en-us/unity-cli/use-unity-cli#install-with-a-package-manager]))
- For prototyping assets from scratch, use `/asset-prototype` skill.
- For sprites, either width and height must be multiple of 4, or pack them in SpriteAtlas, or else no compression is applied.
